    "fact_id": "d959a2b0-61c4-4d06-8207-4951581a0427",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "The self-attention mechanism in transformer architectures allows the model to weigh the importance of different input elements relative to each other.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.5166999999999999,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1774981187.072347,
    "access_count": 5
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "7fd4570b-cf8b-46ae-93ae-ad55f19a9b84",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "The self-attention mechanism in transformer architectures involves query, key, and value vectors.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.5499999999999999,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1774981187.072347,
    "access_count": 5
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "8527e791-6e1c-48f0-949a-cc8c6f2e136f",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "Transformers typically consist of an encoder and a decoder.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.4722,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1774981187.072347,
    "access_count": 3
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "329c5957-51bf-4f84-94e2-7a33b34deb08",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "The encoder in a transformer takes in a sequence of tokens and outputs a sequence of vectors.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.4147,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1774981187.072347,
    "access_count": 3
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "4f257917-4482-4d15-a01b-859c89b324eb",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "The decoder in a transformer generates output tokens based on the vectors from the encoder.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.4633,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1774981187.072347,
    "access_count": 2
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "0e5876c7-5f82-4f10-8b03-6ad74f5200b0",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "Multi-head attention is an extension of the self-attention mechanism that allows the model to jointly attend to information from different representation subspaces at different positions.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.47400000000000003,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1774981187.072347,
    "access_count": 2
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "290dbeb7-251f-410d-9bca-e6c1e22acbf8",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "Positional encoding is used in transformers to add information about the position of each token in the sequence.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.4944,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1774981187.072347,
    "access_count": 2
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "ca6def76-e5f8-4dd6-9370-a76062a219eb",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "Many transformer models are pre-trained on large datasets and then fine-tuned for specific tasks.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.5357,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1774981187.072347,
    "access_count": 5
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "30dac2fa-e643-4386-8946-a8730f184cf7",
    "session_id": "demo-session",
    "text": "The user is studying machine learning and wants to master transformer architectures within a month.",
    "category": "goal",
