  {
    "fact_id": "44801471-2733-4c8b-95c3-9e65d82c37e5",
    "session_id": "default",
    "text": "The transformer attention mechanism is a core component of transformer architectures, which are widely used in natural language processing (NLP) and other fields.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.4608999999999999,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1775039318.857931,
    "access_count": 0
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "a328380c-4cfb-4be2-b057-f9709f6f6fa8",
    "session_id": "default",
    "text": "The self-attention mechanism in transformer architectures involves three main vectors: Query (Q), Key (K), and Value (V).",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.6294,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1775039318.857931,
    "access_count": 0
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "04219a97-0860-4eb9-b754-00525d5e698a",
    "session_id": "default",
    "text": "The attention mechanism computes the weighted sum of the value vectors based on the similarity between the query and key vectors using the scaled dot-product attention mechanism.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.5369999999999999,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1775039318.857931,
    "access_count": 0
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "398e57b0-2471-410b-9519-c1354a830aae",
    "session_id": "default",
    "text": "The formula for computing the attention weights is Attention(Q, K, V) = softmax(Q * K^T / sqrt(d)) * V, where d is the dimensionality of the vectors.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.46669999999999995,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1775039318.857931,
    "access_count": 0
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "5d9854eb-13f7-41c7-a3d6-b2078af49642",
    "session_id": "default",
    "text": "The attention mechanism has benefits including parallelization, handling long-range dependencies, and interpretability.",
    "category": "technical",
    "importance": 0.49999999999999994,
    "source_turn": 3,
    "created_at": 1775039318.857931,
    "access_count": 0
  },
  {
    "fact_id": "acad46a9-bc0a-453b-8616-a4c8f73c345b",
    "session_id": "default",
